Package: digilog
Version: @@VERSION@@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @@INSTALLED_SIZE@@
Maintainer: Controlytics <procurement@controlytics.ai>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), openssl, adduser, procps, ca-certificates
Description: DigiLog - 21 CFR Part 11 temperature & RH monitoring platform
 Self-contained: bundled Node.js runtime, PostgreSQL 18 (private cluster on
 port 5433), EMQX 5.3.2 MQTT broker (1883 / 8883), and the DigiLog application
 served over HTTPS on port 3000 by one process. Installs three systemd services
 (digilog-db, digilog-emqx, digilog-api) and a nightly backup timer. Needs no
 internet access and no reverse proxy on the target machine.
